      "isoDate": "1977-01-18T18:30:00",
      "displayDate": "Jan 18, 1977 • 6:30 PM",
      "content": "I just checked the latest hog prices and it's demoralizing. A year ago we were getting $60 per hundred; now it's dropped below $35. My production costs haven't dropped a cent, but my income just got cut nearly in half.",
      "person_id": "p_005",
      "sourcePdf": "temp/North%20Kent%20Leader%20-%2001-19-1977%20-%20Page%206.pdf"
    },
